# SkyTrixx prototype

This repo is a standalone airline commercial analytics prototype (not Caelix/travel).

- Source Excel: `SkyTrixx_Airline_Commercial_Analytics_Prototype.xlsx` (also under `data/`)
- Dashboard data: `src/data/prototype.json`
- UI entry: `src/standalone-entry.ts` (rendered via `src/main.ts`)
- Shareable single HTML: `share/SkyTrixx-Airline-Analytics-Prototype.html`

When explaining metrics, distinguish:
1. Coupon sample grain (50,000 Air India rows, 10 per flight) — fares, channels, ancillaries, cabins, regions, journey type
2. Flight capacity grain — load factor, ASK, RPK, full flown PAX (IB/OB sectors, Jan 2024–Dec 2025)

Key dimensions: Ticket_Issue_Date vs Flown_Departure_Date; Week_Label Wk-1–Wk-4; Direct vs Connecting (Connecting_Point); cabins First/Business/Premium Economy/Economy; regions Asia/Africa/GCC/Europe/Americas/Domestic India.

Do not invent business numbers. Prefer values from the Excel/JSON.
Keep answers practical for airline commercial / revenue / network users.
